    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fashion Empire in Miami Beach!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>siMarket Cloth Store Simulator</strong>, where your journey from a small boutique to the most luxurious clothing store in Miami Beach begins! Set against the stunning backdrop of palm trees, golden sands, and a vibrant plaza, you\u2019ll manage every aspect of your business\u2014from stocking shelves to satisfying fashion-hungry customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design, Stock &amp; Sell</strong><br>Arrange over <strong>100+ stylish clothing items</strong>\u2014dresses, crop tops, jackets, hats, and more\u2014on shelves, hangers, or eye-catching mannequins. Adjust prices to maximize profits or attract more shoppers. Need space? Expand your <strong>storage</strong> to keep surplus stock and let your restocking team work efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire &amp; Expand</strong><br>Recruit <strong>cashiers</strong> to handle checkouts and <strong>restockers</strong> to keep your store in perfect shape. As you level up (all the way to <strong>level 50!</strong>), unlock new clothing options, expand your store, and add <strong>fitting rooms</strong>\u2014because every customer wants to try before they buy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Dream Store</strong><br>Make your shop stand out with <strong>wall paints, decorative flowers, couches, and stylish signs</strong>. Use <strong>mannequins</strong> to attract more buyers and create the trendiest spot on the strip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Miami Beach Atmosphere</strong><br>Enjoy the <strong>serene yet lively Miami plaza</strong>, where the environment changes dynamically, immersing you in a beachside retail paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Challenge: &quot;Long Shift&quot; Minigame</strong><br>Test your endurance in this fast-paced minigame\u2014how long can you keep up with the rush?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build the ultimate fashion destination? <strong>Start your retail empire today!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Fashion Empire in Miami Beach!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>siMarket Cloth Store Simulator</strong>, where your journey from a small boutique to the most luxurious clothing store in Miami Beach begins! Set against the stunning backdrop of palm trees, golden sands, and a vibrant plaza, you\u2019ll manage every aspect of your business\u2014from stocking shelves to satisfying fashion-hungry customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design, Stock &amp; Sell</strong><br>Arrange over <strong>100+ stylish clothing items</strong>\u2014dresses, crop tops, jackets, hats, and more\u2014on shelves, hangers, or eye-catching mannequins. Adjust prices to maximize profits or attract more shoppers. Need space? Expand your <strong>storage</strong> to keep surplus stock and let your restocking team work efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire &amp; Expand</strong><br>Recruit <strong>cashiers</strong> to handle checkouts and <strong>restockers</strong> to keep your store in perfect shape. As you level up (all the way to <strong>level 50!</strong>), unlock new clothing options, expand your store, and add <strong>fitting rooms</strong>\u2014because every customer wants to try before they buy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Dream Store</strong><br>Make your shop stand out with <strong>wall paints, decorative flowers, couches, and stylish signs</strong>. Use <strong>mannequins</strong> to attract more buyers and create the trendiest spot on the strip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Miami Beach Atmosphere</strong><br>Enjoy the <strong>serene yet lively Miami plaza</strong>, where the environment changes dynamically, immersing you in a beachside retail paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Challenge: &quot;Long Shift&quot; Minigame</strong><br>Test your endurance in this fast-paced minigame\u2014how long can you keep up with the rush?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build the ultimate fashion destination? <strong>Start your retail empire today!</strong></p>",
